# Keep the build context lean and reproducible: never ship local build output into the image.
# The builder regenerates web/dist and web/src/wasm from source, so a stale local copy must not
# leak in. CI checks out clean, but this matters for local `docker build`.
.git/
target/
**/target/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/src/wasm/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
